extensions={'Lymphatic capillary','Thoracic duct','Right lymphatic duct','Cisterna chyli','Left venous angle','Right venous angle','Jugular lymphatic trunk','Subclavian lymphatic trunk','Lumbar lymphatic trunk','Intestinal lymphatic trunk','Bronchomediastinal lymphatic trunk','Lymphatic valve','Endothelial mini-valve','Anchoring filament','Skeletal muscle assistance','Respiratory assistance','Intrinsic lymphatic contraction','Lacteal','Chyle','Chylomicron','Protein recovery','Edema','Lymphedema','Germinal center','Paracortex','Medullary cord','Medullary sinus','Subcapsular sinus','Node hilum','Memory lymphocyte','Phagocytosis','Antigen-presenting cell','Lymphocyte trafficking','Thymic involution','Thymic cortex','Thymic medulla','Thymic epithelial cell','Self-tolerance','Thymocyte','Splenic macrophage','Splenomegaly','Splenectomy','Asplenia','Splenic artery','Splenic vein','Splenic blood filtration','Tonsillar crypt','Ileum','Appendiceal lymphoid tissue','Lymphadenopathy','Lymphadenitis','Lymphangitis','Lymphatic metastasis','Sentinel lymph node','Lymphatic obstruction','Collateral lymphatic drainage'}
